@steelunion/dsh-confirm-gate README · Contributing：PRs and issues are welcome. Suggestions are especially useful on the two open items listed under [Known limits](#9-known-limits) — behaviour in the `12 ~ 15` range, and whether `ask` surfaces correctly once a responder is online.

This is also a candidate for a formal upstream PR to DeepSeek Harness as a low-cost capability proof. If the maintainers would rather host it in-tree, that discussion is welcome.

